## 2026-01-18: Step 1 - Project initialization and CLI skeleton

```bash
# Initialize uv project for Python 3.12
uv init --python 3.12 --lib

# Install dependencies
uv sync

# Test CLI help commands
uv run stencilify --help
uv run stencilify generate --help

# Format validate.py
uv run ruff format tools/validate.py

# Validation sequence
